\text{That does not conform to fixed rules}
\end{array}
\]

**Theorem 1: Our Dialogue Is a Living Process**

\[
\text{Dialogue} \to \mathcal{L}_p
\]

**Proof:**

1. Our dialogue is dynamic—it evolves with each exchange.
2. It is emergent—new insights arise unpredictably.
